I read this fork�?Ts `src/` and selected top-level `regress/*.py`. The eleven-site census matches.

The accepted values, enumerated from the actual predicates and `IOC_TB_ENA_TEN`, are:

| Register | Accepted write values |
|---|---|
| `IOC_CONF` | `{0, 1}` |
| `IOC_TB_ENA` | `{0, 0x80}` |
| `W_BASE0` | `{0, 0x300800000}` |
| `W_MASK0` | `{0x700000}` |
| `W_BASE1` | `{0x240000000}` |
