   **The contrary precedent is in LCA itself:** `W_T_BASE0` and `W_T_BASE1` store and echo writes with `TODO: Actually implement this`: storage without translation behavior, **6**. [First translation-base case](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_lca.c:261), [second](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_lca.c:300). [Luna88k�?Ts interrupt-mask case](C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_luna88k.c:854) likewise reports unsupported bits once but stores the entire value and recomputes interrupts.

